{"product_id":"the-simple-guide-to-having-a-baby-a-step-by-step-illustrated-guide-to-pregnancy-childbirth","title":"The Simple Guide to Having a Baby: A Step-by-Step Illustrated Guide to Pregnancy \u0026 Childbirth","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Simple Guide to Having a Baby is written by the authors of the best-selling Pregnancy, Childbirth, and the Newborn. This book is a simple, just-the-facts guide to pregnancy and childbirth for expectant parents who want only the most important, down-to-earth how-to information on pregnancy, childbirth, and newborn care. The Simple Guide to Having a Baby addresses such concerns as how to stay healthy during pregnancy, how to handle labor pain and birth, and how to care for a new baby.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Penny Simkin | Janet Whalley | Ann Keppler\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780684031293\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45894879772825,"sku":"17RD-4-9780684031293","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/14557443482431.jpg?v=1763204405","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-simple-guide-to-having-a-baby-a-step-by-step-illustrated-guide-to-pregnancy-childbirth","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}